  "ownership": {
    "normal_render": "Complete AboveUI image copied to an owned RGBA8 resource within the normal command list. All visible mesh texture dependencies must be GPU-ready before replacing the retained image.",
    "replay": "Each available composite-only allocator/list is reset only after its presentation fence completed. A current NativeFrame RTV is borrowed for each synchronous replay call.",
    "retirement": "Resource and immutable SRV descriptor retained until both geometry copy fence and presentation replay fence complete.",
    "same_queue_writes": "The retained resource may be reused only on the same DIRECT queue; queue order serializes earlier replay reads, the next image copy, and later replay reads.",
    "shutdown": "wait_idle covers both fences using one total timeout. Drops use bounded 5000ms waits outside rendering; if work remains in flight, associated bounded resources are intentionally retained until process exit.",
    "lock_contention": "All rendering paths use presenter try_lock and do not wait for the owner. A contended presenter can still drop that present; Core integration must keep contention brief.",
    "geometry_busy": "No normal geometry allocator is reset while busy. Bounded texture upload work resumes when a geometry slot becomes available; retained presentation does not perform uploads."
  },
